    "body": "> Is this substantially different from [#3518](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3518)? It doesn't seem like it is to me.\n\nThanks for pointing that out sir..! i just realise it... Yes, this is related to  [#3518](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3518), but my idea focuses more on simple, semantic validation without regex( its main hurdle for beginners ). the differences between my idea and sir #3518 's idea is..,  my idea is to Add specific counts (e.g., mustcontain=\"uppercase:1,digit:2\"), Includes presets like preset=\"strongpassword\" for common rules, Aims for beginner-friendly readability compared to the current syntax. and Maybe these could extend passwordrules instead of being separate!",
